#: ../includes/MCP/Tools/Campaigns.php:216
msgid "Edit a campaign"
msgstr ""

#: ../includes/MCP/Tools/Campaigns.php:217
msgid "Apply campaign edit operations. Supported operations are set_layout (replace the whole element layout), update_meta (change one campaign setting), set_colors and set_donation_amounts. To change the campaign's currency send update_meta with key bpc_currency and a three-letter code: it is refused once the campaign has an approved donation (currency.locked in campaign_get), because its goal and the money already raised are in that currency; the result reports the outcome under currency. Changing the site currency in settings_update never changes a campaign that has its own currency. any other operation (update_block, insert_block, delete_block, move_block, replace_image, generate_image) is not supported here and is reported back under unsupported, never applied. To change one element, send set_layout with the whole layout. To start from a prebuilt design use campaign_apply_template. Fetch the current layout with campaign_get first and echo each element id back unchanged; a re-minted id is treated as a new element. Invalid operations are dropped, not applied."
msgstr ""

